@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@showId = 1

### A - Buscar shows con comentarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search?search_query=girls
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: es
X-Request-ID: search-001

### B - Detalle completo; repetir para verificar cache hit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/show?show_id={{showId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: show-001

### C - Guardar comentario; requiere show existente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "show_id": {{showId}},
  "comment": "Muy buena serie",
  "rating": 4.5
}

### B - Debe incluir el nuevo comentario aun con cache hit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/show?show_id={{showId}}

### A - Buscar el show comentado para ver sus comentarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search?search_query=under%20the%20dome

### Rating invalido: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{"show_id": 1, "comment": "Example", "rating": 6}

### Parametro invalido en ingles: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/show?show_id=0
Accept-Language: en

### Sin coincidencias: arreglo vacio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search?search_query=xyz-nonexistent-show-987654321

### Estado de Atlas
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Contrato OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.yaml
